idth=2;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C82828;fontColor=#C82828;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c273" target="c303"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="99.203125" y="444"/><mxPoint x="1420.0" y="444"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c317" value="&lt;b&gt;Missing details we found&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Nina needs to know where to find her rental number. We added a hint below the field.&lt;br&gt;• Anyone who guesses a rental number could see another customer's rental.&lt;br&gt;• The status word &amp;quot;Requested&amp;quot; means little to a customer, and she did not know what to do while waiting." style="shape=note;size=18;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#282828;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="508" width="755.0" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c318" value="&lt;b&gt;Group decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Nina sees the plate number, so she can find her car at the pickup area.&lt;br&gt;• While Luca prepares the car, Nina sees &amp;quot;Being prepared&amp;quot; and a Refresh button. The stored status stays &amp;quot;Requested&amp;quot;.&lt;br&gt;• Open question for coaching: should Nina also enter her last name to protect her rental details?" style="shape=note;size=18;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#282828;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="805.0" y="508" width="755.0" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>